<<set $chosen_route = "purified_assault">>

PURIFIED COMMANDER: "Orbital strike on tower defenses. Chrome drop-pods. You secure the core. We hold the perimeter."

*Quest Updated: **The Long Walk** — Sector 8 Relay Tower: Purified Assault.*

